### Check first
Open [this component](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/highlights) and its [metrics](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/metrics). Inspect nonzero gRPC status codes and corresponding client errors. The configured threshold is **{{threshold}}** in the monitor chart's unit.

### Likely causes
Invalid requests, authentication failures, deadlines or unavailable shards.

### Fix
Correct the specific status cause, then retry a representative read with the application credentials.

### Verify
The gRPC failure rate returns to zero with successful requests still observed. If samples are absent, investigate the exporter and Collector: this threshold check cannot establish healthy operation without data.
